# Prisma repository

- Class `Prisma*Repository` implements domain `I*Repository`
- Unwrap `TransactionScope` via `unwrapPrismaTxFromScope`
- Keep row mapping in `row-mappers/`
- Map unique/FK Prisma errors to domain errors where needed
